/analysis/
/delivery/*
# 发布说明与设计记录是项目文档，必须入库；同目录的 APK / build.json 属构建产物，继续忽略。
# 白名单按文件名前缀收窄：/delivery/ 下还有几十份逐版本的临时笔记，未审阅前不入库。
!/delivery/release-*.md
!/delivery/ui-beautify-*.md
# The update manifest and its landing page are source for the release channel; the packages
# beside them are build output and stay out of the repository.
!/delivery/update/
/delivery/update/*.apk
